<article class="env-corollary" id="1B2D22">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/1B2D22">Corollary <span data-tag="1B2D22">7.3.5.3</span>.</a> Let $X$ be a coherent topological space. Then the global sections functor $\Gamma : \Shv (X) \rightarrow \SSet $ is a proper map of $\infty $-topoi. </p>
</article>
<article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Identical to the proof of Corollary <a href="/tag/58EC01" data-tag="58EC01">7.3.4.11</a>, using Theorem <a href="/tag/B9FAF0" data-tag="B9FAF0">7.3.5.2</a> in place of Corollary <a href="/tag/B9C4E7" data-tag="B9C4E7">7.3.4.10</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>